---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Canyon Strategic Wealth"
  description="How Canyon Strategic Wealth protects and handles your personal information."
>
  <div class="page-header">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>How we protect and handle your personal information.</p>
  </div>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="compliance-content">
      <h3>Information We Collect</h3>
      <p>
        Canyon Strategic Wealth collects personal information necessary to provide financial
        advisory services, including names, contact information, financial account data, tax
        information, and other details relevant to your financial plan. We collect this information
        directly from you, from your authorized representatives, and from third-party custodians
        with your consent.
      </p>

      <h3>How We Use Your Information</h3>
      <p>
        We use your personal information solely for the purpose of providing financial advisory
        services, maintaining your accounts, communicating with you about your financial plan, and
        complying with regulatory requirements. We do not sell, rent, trade, or otherwise disclose
        your personal information to third parties for their own marketing or promotional purposes.
      </p>

      <h3>Information Sharing</h3>
      <p>
        We do not sell or share your personal information with other companies for their own
        marketing, advertising, or promotional purposes. We disclose your information only in these
        limited circumstances:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>At your direction.</strong> With your custodian (Charles Schwab) or with your
          other professional advisors, such as CPAs and attorneys, when you ask us to.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>To service providers acting on our behalf.</strong> Vendors that perform support
          services for us, such as email delivery, scheduling, and secure document storage. These
          vendors may use your information only to perform those services for Canyon Strategic
          Wealth and are bound by written confidentiality obligations. They may not use or share it
          for their own purposes.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>As required by law.</strong> To regulatory authorities, or in response to a
          subpoena, court order, or other legal process.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h3>SMS and Text Messaging</h3>
      <p>
        <strong>No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes. All of the above categories exclude text messaging originator opt-in data and consent; this information will not be shared with any third parties.</strong>
      </p>
      <p>
        By providing your mobile number and opting in, you consent to receive text messages from
        Canyon Strategic Wealth related to your inquiry, scheduling, and your financial plan.
        Consent to receive text messages is not a condition of any purchase or of receiving our
        services. Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply.
      </p>
      <p>
        You may opt out at any time by replying <strong>STOP</strong> to any message from us. You
        will receive a confirmation message and we will not send you further texts unless you opt
        in again. Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for assistance, or contact us at
        <a href="mailto:jake@canyonstrategicwealth.com">jake@canyonstrategicwealth.com</a> or
        <a href="tel:+18019038287">(801) 903-8287</a>. Carriers are not liable for delayed or
        undelivered messages.
      </p>
      <p>
        Mobile numbers and SMS consent records are used only by Canyon Strategic Wealth to send the
        messages you signed up for. We do not sell, rent, or share this information, and we do not
        share it with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes. We share it
        only with the messaging provider that transmits our texts on our behalf, solely to deliver
        those messages to you, and only as required by law.
      </p>

      <h3>Data Security</h3>
      <p>
        We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your personal information,
        including encryption, secure access controls, and regular security assessments. Our
        custodian, Charles Schwab, provides SIPC protection and maintains comprehensive
        cybersecurity infrastructure.
      </p>

      <h3>Your Rights</h3>
      <p>
        You have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal information at any time. You
        may also opt out of marketing communications, and you may opt out of text messages at any
        time by replying STOP. To exercise any of these rights, please contact us at
        <a href="mailto:jake@canyonstrategicwealth.com">jake@canyonstrategicwealth.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h3>Contact Us</h3>
      <p>
        If you have questions about this privacy policy, please contact Jake Cazier at
        <a href="mailto:jake@canyonstrategicwealth.com">jake@canyonstrategicwealth.com</a> or call
        <a href="tel:+18019038287">(801) 903-8287</a>.
      </p>

      <p style="margin-top:40px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-light);">
        Last updated: August 2026
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
